+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2503.06377.
+
+The family uses the paper's native ``X_5`` vectors.  A row ``s`` with five
+entries -1 and five entries +1 encodes
+
+    v(s) = (s/2, 0^10, (1/2,-1/2)) in A_9 (x) A_9 (x) A_1.
+
