+
+There are 16 displayed candidate sign rows s. Every row has length 10,
+has exactly five -1 entries and five +1 entries, and encodes
+
+    v(s) = (s_0/2,...,s_9/2, 0,...,0, 1/2,-1/2) in Q^22,
