	Let $c_1,\ldots,c_6$ be the conjugates
	$
		(1, 2, 3, 4)$, $
		(1, 3, 2, 4)$, $
		(1, 2, 4, 3)$, $
		(1, 3, 4, 2)$, $
		(1, 4, 2, 3)$, $
		(1, 4, 3, 2)
	$
	of the cyclic permutation $(1,2,3,4)$ in $S_4$,
