The audited module now passes every local gate: G1–G9(c), including 0/200,000 valid structure-aware guesses, four attacks at 0/8, exact search solving 8/8 as the disclosed Track-B reference, 20/20 canonical relabelling checks, and a 444-character/120-atom witness. The only unmet requirement is external STEP 4: the fresh hardener run was refused four times with OpenRouter HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” so no model attempt was scored and I will not label that as hardness evidence.
