codex
The second bare oracle (Gemini 3.8 Flash) solved `easy`, so that preset is disqualified regardless of the third result. This is useful hardening evidence, not a gate failure: the harness will now finish the level and escalate to `medium` while the 12-row answer remains fixed-length.
